msgid "Ink Context Blog"
msgstr "Ink Context Blog"

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "The WordPress theme Ink Context Blog is a customizable, context-focused theme that is available for free. Selection of posts is based on various contexts, including category, date, and comment count. The customizer's preview allows you to access and fully customize the theme. Its sectioned and article-based HTML5 structure guarantees top SEO performance. For bloggers wishing to boost their online visibility and search engine rankings, the Ink Context Blog WordPress theme is a flexible, customizable, and SEO-friendly choice. Demo is here https://contextblog.postmagthemes.com/inkcontextblog"
msgstr "The WordPress theme Ink Context Blog is a customizable, context-focused theme that is available for free. Selection of posts is based on various contexts, including category, date, and comment count. The Customiser's preview allows you to access and fully customise the theme. Its sectioned and article-based HTML5 structure guarantees top SEO performance. For bloggers wishing to boost their online visibility and search engine rankings, the Ink Context Blog WordPress theme is a flexible, customisable, and SEO-friendly choice. The demo is here: https://contextblog.postmagthemes.com/inkcontextblog."

